    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101211/2001012110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001012110060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "近付くと、お星様の瞬きの中にいるみたいで、\r\n星空の中をお散歩している気分になれるんです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101211/2001012110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組MC",
    "text": "うんうん、目の前にするとそんなに綺麗なんだ\r\nますます行ってみたくなるな～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
